+#### srt_groupof
+
+```
+SRTSOCKET srt_groupof(SRTSOCKET socket);
+```
+
+Returns the group ID of the socket, or `SRT_INVALID_SOCK` if the socket
+doesn't exist or it's not a member of any group.
+
+
