+### Option Descriptions
+
+#### SRTO_BINDTODEVICE
+
+| OptName               | Since | Restrict | Type     | Units  | Default  | Range  | Dir |Entity|
+| --------------------- | ----- | -------- | -------- | ------ | -------- | ------ |-----|------|
